# MUST BE INCONSISTENT: the two transmission modes are disjoint. ISO/IEC
# 7498-1, 6.4 treats connection-mode and connectionless-mode as alternatives.
@prefix iso7498: <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#> .
@prefix inst: <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498/instances#> .
@prefix ex: <https://w3id.org/aias/example/iso7498/neg#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/example/iso7498/neg02> a owl:Ontology ;
    owl:imports <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498/instances/2.0.0> .
ex:Comm a iso7498:ConnectionModeAssociation , iso7498:ConnectionlessModeAssociation .
